"P667886897" "You drop some more coins into the slot machine, but before you've even pulled the lever, the main display lights up, with the word: 'JACKPOT!'. There's no rolling wheels or flashing lights, but the text on the screen begins to explain the game: <br><br>'Bonus Game: Council Crusher! Defeat all Council in base! Find plans for SUPERWEAPONS!!! <br>Would you like to play this game?' <br><br>The 'Yes' button glows expectantly."
