// Dialog :
"P1859191994" "The lights on the Slot Machine build up to a crescendo, and then a clattering fountain of coins start to pour into the tray. As you gather them in big handfuls, words slowly crawl across the orange screen: <br><br>'I'm sorry I had to lie to you like that. <br>But I had to try to save him. <br>Here's all that I owe you, and a little more. <br>I won't bother you again.' <br><br>As the last coin clinks into the reward tray, the jackpot sounds fade, the wheels slow to a stop, and the lights on the Slot Machine dim and go out."
// RandomFameString :
"P3561978893" "My cousin in Poughkeepsie says that they got this crazy new shop teacher at the local highschool named Mr. Roller."

